    "chunk_text": "um f\u00e6derum Abrahame & hys s\u00e6de on a woruld. So\u00felice Maria wunude mid hyre swylce \u00fery mon\u00feas, & gewende \u00fea to hyre huse. \u00d0a w\u00e6s gefylled Elizabethe cenningtid, & heo sunu cende. & hyre nehcheburas & hyre cu\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6t drihten hys mildheortnesse mid hyre m\u00e6rsude, \u00d0a on \u00feam ehteo\u00fean d\u00e6ge hig comon \u00fe\u00e6t cild ymsni\u00fean, & nemdon hyne hys f\u00e6der naman \u00d0a andswarode his modor nese so\u00fees, ac he by\u00f0 Iohannes genemned. \u00d0a cw\u00e6don hig to hyre, nis nan on \u00feinre m\u00e6g\u00f0e \u00feyson naman genemned. \u00d0a bicnodon hi to hys f\u00e6der hw\u00e6t he wolde hine genemnedne beon. \u00dea wrat he gebedenum wexbrede, Iohannes is hys nama; \u00f0a wundrodon hig ealle. \u00d0a wear\u00f0 sona hys mu\u00f0 & hys tunge geopenod & he spr\u00e6c Drihten bletsiende. \u00d0a wear\u00f0 ege geworden ofer ealle hyra nehcheburas, & ofer ealle Iudea muntland w\u00e6ron \u00feas word & ealle \u00fea \u00f0e hit gehyrdon on heora heortan settun & cw\u00e6don; Wenstu hw\u00e6t by\u00f0 \u00fees cnapa; And Zacharias his f\u00e6der w\u00e6s mid halegum gaste afylled, & he witegode & cw\u00e6\u00fe; Gebletsud si Swa he spr\u00e6c \u00feurh hys halegra witegena mu\u00f0, \u00fea he of worldes frym\u00f0e spr\u00e6con, & he alysde us of Hyne us to syllenne \u00feone a\u00f0, \u00fee he urum f\u00e6der Abrahame sw",
